"Source reviewed, not run here. Editor eligibility, platform builds and version compatibility need local checks. The develop branch is not a stable evaluation baseline.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Select a release tag, install its supported Unity editor and open the included Project.","Install the matching com.unity.ml-agents package and Python environment package versions.","Open an example scene and connect a policy; route actions by behavior and agent_id, and read both DecisionSteps and TerminalSteps. Python step advances to the next decision, not necessarily one physics frame.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Compare physics-task success with fixed observations, decisions and reset rules.","Change a C# agent or scene and verify sensors, rewards and episode termination.","Import a replacement rig or collider and check control stability and visual observations.","AI 使用与评估条件","The toolkit supports agent research and automated testing; its Apache license does not replace editor or third-party asset terms.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98,99],"evidence",{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"Unity editor terms","https://unity.com/legal/editor-terms-of-service/software","Third-party notices","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/blob/develop/Third%20Party%20Notices.md","Release 23 low-level decision and terminal contract","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/blob/a2777719560e4676be99e2ea128c5eb1fbeb3dbb/com.unity.ml-agents/Documentation~/Python-LLAPI.md","Official toolkit and release compatibility","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents#readme","查看许可条款",[111],"licenseUrl",{"_58":108,"_25":112},"https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/blob/develop/LICENSE.md","许可类别","引擎专用许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Check bundled notices and any added scene assets. The Unity editor and external store assets have separate terms.","assetLicense","代码许可","Apache-2.0 for the toolkit, with third-party notices.","codeLicense","开始使用",[126],"access",{"_58":127,"_25":128,"_129":130},"Free toolkit; Unity editor required","https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents/releases","note","Choose one release and match its Unity package, Python packages and supported editor version.","主要来源",[134],"sourceUrl",{"_58":131,"_25":135},"https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/ml-agents","技术栈","Unity · C# · Python · sensors and agent actions","stack","适用方向",[142,143],"dimensions","2D","3D","测试目标",[147,148,149],"uses","代码修改与自动试玩","视觉、控制与规划","资产与动画流程","资源类型","AI 评估环境","lead","summary","environment",[168,169,170],[166,167],{"_58":127,"_25":128,"_129":130},"engine",[162,163,164,165],[86,87,88],[79,80,81],{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"2d","3d","coding","playing","pipeline",{"_172":173},"documents",{"_67":174,"_35":175},[177,181,182,183,180,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,179,216,178,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237],[176,177,178,179,180],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-r